---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Pricing | Credits That Count"
  description="Full Plan $79 one time, Signed Audit $199 one time, Plan Monitoring $9 per month. Delivered in 48 hours or less, with a written make it right policy."
>
  <div class="container">
    <section class="block" style="margin-top:26px;">
      <h2>Plans and pricing</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Every paid product is delivered by email as a printable document,
        dated and edition stamped, with the source list attached. Turnaround
        is always 48 hours or less, for the Full Plan and the Signed Audit
        alike.
      </p>

      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Full Plan</h3>
          <p class="price">$79 <small>one time</small></p>
          <ul>
            <li>Semester by semester Louisiana Transfer Degree plan</li>
            <li>Admission standing at the target college</li>
            <li>AP credit outcomes</li>
            <li>Savings estimate from published tuition schedules</li>
            <li>Application packet with deadlines and next steps</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="btn" href="https://buy.stripe.com/cNi3cvced1y6bXh5lzbAs07">Get the Full Plan</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card featured">
          <h3>Signed Audit</h3>
          <p class="price">$199 <small>one time</small></p>
          <ul>
            <li>Everything in the Full Plan</li>
            <li>A Credit Transfer Pro's personal review of the plan against the published sources</li>
            <li>Signed by a Credit Transfer Pro</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="btn" href="https://buy.stripe.com/00w00jdih7Wu7H115jbAs08">Get the Signed Audit</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Plan Monitoring</h3>
          <p class="price">$9 <small>per month</small></p>
          <ul>
            <li>Your plan kept current as catalogs and requirements change</li>
            <li>Updated plan issued when a change affects your student</li>
            <li>Cancel any time</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="btn" href="https://buy.stripe.com/14AfZhgut7Wu6CX29nbAs09">Add Plan Monitoring</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <div class="secgroup">
        <p class="secband">Our make it right policy</p>
        <p>
          If a plan or audit is wrong because our data was wrong, we fix it
          and refund it: the family receives a corrected plan at no charge
          and a full refund of what they paid for that product.
        </p>
        <p>
          If a college changed its requirements after the plan date, the
          corrected plan is issued at no charge and the plan's monitoring
          option covers the update.
        </p>
      </div>
      <p>
        Not sure which one fits? Start with the
        <a href="/checker/">free checker</a>, or read
        <a href="/how-it-works/">how delivery works</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="tagline-foot">Know before you go.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
